id: ally-barrier
name: Ally Barrier
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 6+
tpCost: 15
# "If an Ally who is not at Long Range is hit by an Attacking Maneuver, you can use the Barrier Unique Ability as if
# you were the target of that Attacking Maneuver but apply its effects to that Character (you still make the Wound
# Roll for its effects)." Barrier's button offered for whoever it hit that is not at Long Range from you.
allyBarrier: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Barrier used for an Ally hit who is not at Long Range: your Wound Roll, their Damage reduced.
text: >
  Ally Barrier: You wrap your barrier around another person, shielding them from harm.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 6+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –Effect: If an Ally who is not at Long Range is hit by an Attacking Maneuver, you can use the Barrier Unique
  Ability as if you were the target of that Attacking Maneuver but apply its effects to that Character (you still
  make the Wound Roll for its effects).
